ucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SDMQ7YA1Sh0Q7kNvwFmaMB8&_nc_oc=Adp-jBNfAWtrRzBqh5mF9F46GAnbwZV55ol_yddPaZiWYAv87VPK2RPfwZknqO64_ro&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTcrxsNiW76HtrStLGVZP5I8W0weqkSX5IlNu02XLQ4BA&oe=6AFB1EC8"}, {"file_name": "leafblower_tooltrial.png", "id": "1092313986977496", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673652249_1092313990310829_8151617817680456674_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GAKF3x4i5VUQ7kNvwHtEXTk&_nc_oc=AdqWqZXDqfgZlp-vkfhbIlq3_J-jMtqvG84mnw2FORedivYhArmN98hSt-WFOYDVI90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSB_q1SvcC-jq-Mdf4Jx9oc3UPQ9-rk-1nc1ZY_Y72Dgg&oe=6AFB4CA3"}, {"file_name": "powerwash_shark_pool.png", "id": "1061824586883272", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830576_1061824590216605_8620775107247838807_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LWeeXVTm-DMQ7kNvwFtBViY&_nc_oc=Adp-jgoH4Uzufkp9zKjnuOrr1Cw0_7y0AJD1mQCK_aPBE4mUDJHkjqx2LVEJEyrarqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxoW8pE5hlUcRw9jShXdKEsbHmvSh2_LJD5xB2NaCIiQ&oe=6AFB336E"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_002_0111.png", "id": "1114575188092491", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1114575191425824_5630311466742647100_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0lM-EtuaOPcQ7kNvwGeoOdT&_nc_oc=Adr3FLJVsLGXS-W1y5Ps0h8iV7GmB61tu-3haQY-0Prcp5745r-bXm4puDeMD9QJXf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRiqGOEUzcc6f475YXF0QNGoULuSsRVKC7mfdv2-MKKRg&oe=6AFB34E2"}, {"file_name": "image0129.png", "id": "1294088576118022", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823899_1294088586118021_2428145400071387291_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k87ds4sQow4Q7kNvwHLTG7f&_nc_oc=Adr-wZNB2usk3bex7AJY_eyJhHCUnemhpApeGDfEaenTK-0E0D3QKLpXXGe5YWjOtfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR6O5wnR05WNTe5e46DvVNsd5f9CeXNigb5z1Puu6ff0A&oe=6AFB4472"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cleaning_Simulator_2560x1440 (1).png", "id": "1287782773505792", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303116_1287782776839125_5498191826674170009_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WyJaQwCIHkEQ7kNvwGog1ga&_nc_oc=Adr1RC0fXp6_pp3byOR7Gm6Ww1sC1b8AGnR7mSbikCly_nOhzlyzNlVwpPeE_qCoRDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRPSrc9tipQKwE48wdPmLRD_XO7zGA46ZAzDkZhgNbPiA&oe=6AFB20A1"}, "display_name": "Cleaning Simulator VR", "keywords": ["cleaning", "powerwash", "relaxing", "simulation", "simulator"], "long_description": "# \ud83e\uddfd The Ultimate VR Cleaning Experience\nSome people find peace in meditation. You're about to find it in a filthy room and a pressure washer.\n\n## \ud83e\uddfc Clean Your Way\nPick your weapon:\n\n* \ud83d\udca6 **Power Wash** \u2013 Point, squeeze, watch years of grime just vanish\n{2459090457961338}\n* \ud83c\udf43 **Leaf Blower** \u2013 Blast away the mess and enjoy the satisfying power of a gust of air\n{1108120248671949}\n\n* \ud83e\udd16 **Robot Vacuum** \u2013 Take control of a cleaning robot and guide it around to tackle the mess\n{1193160920060476}\n\n* \ud83e\udee7 **Soap & Scrub** \u2013 Foam it up, scrub it down, see your reflection in it\n{28906924055595622}\n\n* \ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f **Garbage Collection** \u2013 Somebody's got to haul it out, and today that's you\n{1522415972438018}\n\n## \ud83c\udf0d Interactive Environments\nEvery room is a disaster waiting to happen, in the best way possible.\n\n* Poke at, pick up, and move basically anything\n* Dirt that reacts to what you're actually doing\n* Real progress you can see as you work\n* A rhythm that's honestly hard to put down\n\nYou'll look up and realize an hour's gone. It happens.\n\n## \ud83d\udc65 Living World\nYou're not doing this alone. Sharky's hanging around, tossing you the occasional job and pulling pranks the second you let your guard down. He's chaotic, he's interactive, and he's absolutely going to mess with you while you work.\n{2154302421862746}\n\n## \u23f1\ufe0f Rush Mode & Leaderboards\nRace against the clock in **Rush Mode**, beat your best times, and climb the leaderboards to prove you're among the best cleaners.\n\n\n\n## \ud83c\udf10 Play Your Way\nAvailable in **English, German, and French**.\n\nGrab your tools, get your hands dirty, and turn every mess into a masterpiece!\n\n", "short_description": "Someone has to clean up after the aliens. Might as well be you.\nPower wash a crashed UFO, scrub a giant's breakfast off the stove, and blow a mountain of leaves into one tiny circle. Watch the grime peel away one clean stripe at a time until the whole thing shines. It's weirdly satisfying, and you won't want to put the hose down.\nBest part? None of it is your mess."}]}, "developer_name": "OneLight Interactive", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.onelightinteractive.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "OneLight Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.onelightinteractive.com/cleaning-simulator", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interact